* ACM3 (acm3_va) PMOS perL cards for IHP SG13G2 low-voltage devices, 27 C.
* Model: models/acm3.va (Version 3.0.0). Usage (ngspice with OSDI):
*   pre_osdi acm3.osdi   (build: openvaf-r acm3.va)
*   .include acm3_pmos_perL.lib
*   N1 d g s b <card name> w=10u l=0.13u ad=3.4p as=3.4p pd=20.68u ps=20.68u
* Validity: each card is valid at its L and for W >= 2 um. V_B = 0 extraction (body effect not measured).
* Specific current: I_S = ish*w/l of the instance (ish = I_S L/W of the extraction).
* DC parameters: extracted from the IHP measurements https://github.com/IHP-GmbH/IHP-Open-PDK/tree/main/ihp-sg13g2/libs.doc/meas/MOS/SG13_pmosXm1Y3
*   (300 K, V_B = 0; differential evolution + L-BFGS-B on I_D-V_G, I_D-V_D and their derivatives).
* tox = 1.9704e-09 m and epsrox = 3.9: IHP PSP103 card (TOXO, EPSROXO).
* dlc (charge length l - dlc) and ld (overlap length): fitted to the PSP103 gate-row capacitances
*   (C_gs, C_gd, C_gb at 100 MHz, V_GS 0-1.2 V, V_DS 0 and 1.2 V) of the W = 10 um devices; one ld for all L.
*   dlc is an effective per-card value: at L >= 0.5 um it also absorbs the lower PSP inversion capacitance
*   (fitted scale L_C/L = 0.6-0.8), not only a length offset. Each card states its capacitance-fit RMS.
* Junction: fitted to the PSP103 drain-junction C(V), 0-1.2 V reverse, four layouts (RMS 0.41 %).
* Not extracted (model defaults): temperature coefficients, flicker noise n_ot, mismatch avt0/ak.
* rg = 0: set the gate resistance per device on the instance line.

* Extracted at W = 10 um, L = 0.12 um; use at L = 0.12 um, W >= 2 um. C_gs/C_gd/C_gb fit RMS 5.2 % of C_gg
.model acm3p_L0p12 acm3_va
+ type=-1
+ vt0=0.4558698393
+ ish=7.031109616e-08
+ phi=1.757020027
+ gamma=1.07081273
+ theta=0.02920012707
+ zeta=0.01379999944
+ sigma_wi=0.04594610759
+ sigma_si=0.2286133946
+ dlc=9.480088515e-08
+ ld=2.892876716e-08
+ tox=1.9704e-09
+ epsrox=3.9
+ cj0=0.0008840642831
+ xd_mj=0.3579077876
+ phi_zero=0.668960069
+ cj0sw=0.0002088951183
+ xd_mjsw=0.2714787334
+ phi_zerosw=1.022288069
+ xj=1.5e-07
+ tref=300.15
+ rg=0
+ vddmax=1.4

